@concepts

Purpose:
  Central concept registry with aliases and ambiguity resolution.
  Maps terminology to references and skills.

Owns: ./

Registry:
  - concept_id: <unique identifier>
    canonical_name: <human-readable name>
    aliases: [alternative names]
    avoid_terms: [confusing terms]
    reference: <primary reference>
    skills: [related skills]
    projects: [using projects]

Rules:
  [C1] Every concept MUST have a canonical name.
  [C2] Aliases MUST map to exactly one concept.
  [C3] Ambiguous terms MUST be flagged, not guessed.
  [C4] Concepts MUST be context-aware.
  [C5] Concept drift MUST be detected and recorded.
  [C6] Conflicting concepts MUST be separated.

Resolution:
  priority:
    1. exact reference
    2. project-local alias
    3. parent index alias
    4. global alias
    5. semantic search
    6. ask human

Navigation:
  Canonicalization: @CANONICALIZATION.sdd
  Promotion: @promotion.sdd
  KnowledgeModel: @KNOWLEDGE-MODEL.sdd
  RelationshipVocabulary: @RELATIONSHIP-VOCABULARY.sdd
  EpistemicEntities: @epistemic-entities.sdd
  DecisionCanvas: @decision-canvas.sdd
  ReasoningPipeline: @reasoning-pipeline.sdd
  References: @../references/INDEX.sdd
  Skills: @../skills/INDEX.sdd
  Projects: @../projects/INDEX.sdd
  Graph: @../graph/INDEX.sdd
  Timeline: @../timeline/INDEX.sdd

State: +
